<title>USA: ROC amends merger deal with Chateau.</title>
<headline>ROC amends merger deal with Chateau.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Calif. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The boards of ROC Communities Inc and Chateau Properties Inc have approved an amended merger agreement, ROC said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Details of the pact were not disclosed by ROC.</p>
<p>Since Chateau and ROC signed a merger agreement in July, two companies have approached Chateau with merger offers of their own. Chateau said on Wednesday it had rejected those offers.</p>
</text>
